{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Desktropolis</i> is an <strong>idle city builder\u00a0</strong>that lives quietly on the bottom of your screen while you work, game, or study.         <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/2a1479f394aec8988d6fbbe602ae183c.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Grow and manage your city as the mayor entirely from your virtual phone. Build, trade, and hire employees, or slack off, play mini-games, and gamble city funds.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/a65972cea2c4ff34e87318100e601c19.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Specialize and experiment with different building types and classes to create overpowered synergies that maximize your city\u2019s growth and profitability. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/ccc41fae4c827c06475ba02101bda7df.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Keep your citizens happy and fortify buildings from disasters that can strike at any moment, or play on peaceful mode without interruptions. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/14a8f3084c92be117ba3f43339c891de.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Spruce up your boring desktop and modify your entire experience with customizable city colors, phone cases and wallpapers, landscapes and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/97180a5fbcb1a9718e2dc7534ab0c6ec.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Desktropolis is an authentic idle experience that was designed to play entirely at your own pace while never demanding your attention. While the speed of progression varies heavily based on optimization and activity, it's best enjoyed while doing other things. Just build, relax, and watch your tiny city come to life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722850?t=1771215598","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/5abc19493c15c6be9c50b2047b76ea36ab292d93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771215598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/117021ef2e720fba131ab3ed5a45002acf50758f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771215598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/117021ef2e720fba131ab3ed5a45002acf50758f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771215598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Desktropolis</i> is an <strong>idle city builder\u00a0</strong>that lives quietly on the bottom of your screen while you work, game, or study.         <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/2a1479f394aec8988d6fbbe602ae183c.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Grow and manage your city as the mayor entirely from your virtual phone. Build, trade, and hire employees, or slack off, play mini-games, and gamble city funds.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/a65972cea2c4ff34e87318100e601c19.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Specialize and experiment with different building types and classes to create overpowered synergies that maximize your city\u2019s growth and profitability. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/ccc41fae4c827c06475ba02101bda7df.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Keep your citizens happy and fortify buildings from disasters that can strike at any moment, or play on peaceful mode without interruptions. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/14a8f3084c92be117ba3f43339c891de.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Spruce up your boring desktop and modify your entire experience with customizable city colors, phone cases and wallpapers, landscapes and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/extras/97180a5fbcb1a9718e2dc7534ab0c6ec.avif?t=1771215598\" width=1560 height=81 /></span>Desktropolis is an authentic idle experience that was designed to play entirely at your own pace while never demanding your attention. While the speed of progression varies heavily based on optimization and activity, it's best enjoyed while doing other things. Just build, relax, and watch your tiny city come to life.</p>","developers":["Bean Juice Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722850/5f00f833d09136feea6158de196a57580aa7b60a/header.jpg?t=1771215598","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 Bean Juice Studios","linux_requirements"